  "title": "Visions from Grogu's Troubling Past",
  "description": "The Great Jedi Purge, when Darth Sidious declared the Jedi to be the enemies of the Republic, was a black day for the galaxy. Grogu survived this dark moment in history, but his memories became blocked for unknown reasons. With the help of Luke Skywalker, Grogu was able to tap back into these memories, and remember those Jedi who gave their lives to protect him from the advancing clone army the day they were given Order 66. The images are difficult for Grogu, but ultimately help open his eyes to what he'd really been through."
